    <string name="tip_slot_cars_1">Hold your pad to speed up and let go to brake. Slow down before the amber signs.</string>
    <string name="tip_slot_cars_2">Too fast in a bend and the car leaves the slot and loses time. Watch the grip bar.</string>
    <string name="tip_slot_cars_3">Too quick? Turn on Slow motion or Step by step in the setup.</string>
    <string name="tip_fishing_1">Pick a spot, hold the button and let go to cast. The farther out, the bigger the fish.</string>
    <string name="tip_fishing_2">Press the button when the bobber plunges, not for small nibbles.</string>
    <string name="tip_fishing_3">Hold to reel in, let go when the fish pulls, and keep the tension bar in the Good zone.</string>
